{"docKey":"0003_longest_substring_without_repeating_characters","code":"class Solution:\n    \"\"\"\n    无重复字符的最长子串 - 滑动窗口\n\n    核心思想：\n    用滑动窗口维护一个不包含重复字符的子串，窗口右边界不断右移扩展，\n    遇到重复字符时收缩左边界，保证窗口内无重复字符。\n\n    为什么用哈希表？\n    哈希表记录每个字符最后一次出现的位置，可以在 O(1) 时间内判断字符是否重复，\n    并快速确定左边界应该移动到哪里。\n\n    滑动窗口的关键：\n    1. left：窗口左边界\n    2. i：窗口右边界（当前遍历位置）\n    3. hash_dict：记录字符最后一次出现的索引\n\n    时间复杂度：O(n)，每个字符只访问一次\n    空间复杂度：O(min(m,n))，m 是字符集大小\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def lengthOfLongestSubstring(self, s: str) -> int:\n        hash_dict = {}  # 记录字符最后一次出现的索引\n        n = len(s)\n        left, ans, result = 0, 0, 0  # left:左边界, ans:当前窗口长度, result:最大长度\n\n        for i in range(0, n):\n            if hash_dict.get(s[i], -1) == -1:\n                # 字符未出现过，窗口直接扩展\n                ans += 1\n            else:\n                # 字符出现过，需要收缩左边界\n                # 注意：left 只能右移不能左移（取 max 保证）\n                if left < hash_dict[s[i]]:\n                    left = hash_dict[s[i]]\n                ans = i - left  # 重新计算当前窗口长度\n\n            hash_dict[s[i]] = i  # 更新字符位置\n            result = max(ans, result)  # 更新最大长度\n\n        return result","method":"lengthOfLongestSubstring","paramNames":["s"],"argKinds":["none"],"args":["\"pwwkew\""],"expected":"3","result":3,"events":[{"line":23,"locals":{"s":"pwwkew"},"depth":1},{"line":24,"locals":{"s":"pwwkew","hash_dict":{}},"depth":1},{"line":25,"locals":{"s":"pwwkew","hash_dict":{},"n":6},"depth":1},{"line":27,"locals":{"s":"pwwkew","hash_dict":{},"n":6,"left":0,"ans":0,"result":0},"depth":1},{"line":28,"locals":{"s":"pwwkew","hash_dict":{},"n":6,"left":0,"ans":0,"result":0,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":30,"locals":{"s":"pwwkew","hash_dict":{},"n":6,"left":0,"ans":0,"result":0,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":38,"locals":{"s":"pwwkew","hash_dict":{},"n":6,"left":0,"ans":1,"result":0,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":39,"locals":{"s":"pwwkew","hash_dict":{"p":0},"n":6,"left":0,"ans":1,"result":0,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":27,"locals":{"s":"pwwkew","hash_dict":{"p":0},